// The impl core/async's reader trait requires after MoonBit 0.10.20, which
// 0.10.20 refuses, so no source file builds on both. On a toolchain that
// requires it, the canary (.github/workflows/canary.yml) copies this file to
// jsonrpc-async/src/lifecycle_next_wbtest.mbt. When moonbit-version moves past
// 0.10.20, move it there for good and delete compat/.

///|
impl @io.BinaryReaderImpl for ChunkReader with fn name(_) {
  "ChunkReader"
}
